  "notes": "{誤解|ごかい} means misunderstanding.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {誤解|ごかい}する (to misunderstand)\n- {誤解|ごかい}される (to be misunderstood)\n- {誤解|ごかい}を{招|まね}く (to invite misunderstanding)\n- {誤解|ごかい}を{解|と}く (to clear up a misunderstanding)\n- {誤解|ごかい}が{生|う}じる (a misunderstanding arises)\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- {誤解|ごかい}のないように (so there's no misunderstanding)\n- {誤解|ごかい}を{恐|おそ}れずに{言|い}えば (if I may say so without being misunderstood)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {誤解|ごかい}: misunderstanding (incorrect interpretation)\n- {勘違|かんちが}い: misconception, wrong idea\n- {誤|あやま}り: error, mistake",
